            <ArticleTitle>Infundibulopyelostomy for vascular obstruction of a middle infundibulum.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>99-101</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The syndrome of nephralgia caused by vascular compression of a superior infundibulum of the kidney and its surgical resolution are reported. A case is presented to demonstrate that this syndrome also can involve a middle infundibulum, which can be treated by the same surgical technique.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
